<title>USA: Dell Computer Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	    $  1.52		 $   0.75</p>
<p> Net			145,000		   75,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,019,000		1,415,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	95,500		  100,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call Mean Estimate $1.16/shr.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 quarter shr includes extraordinary charge of $0.04 per share. Before the charge, Q3 result was $1.56/shr.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
